interpolation linear
gradient greenGauss
convection upwind
diffusion orthogonal
time steady
maxIterations 1200
velocityRelaxation 0.5
pressureRelaxation 0.3
continuityTolerance 1e-7
velocityTolerance 1e-6
velocitySolver bicgstab ilut 1e-14 1e-8 1200
pressureSolver cg incompleteCholesky 1e-14 1e-8 1200
